
## tree.aside · --help
rc=0
git.tree.aside — set a tree's uncommitted edits aside under a tag, then lay them back

usage:
  rhx git.tree.aside set --tag <tag> --path <file> [--path <file> …]
  rhx git.tree.aside get --tag <tag>
  rhx git.tree.aside get                 # every entry held

## tree.aside · no verb refuses
rc=2
✋ ConstraintError: name a verb: set or get
   └─ see: rhx git.tree.aside --help

## tree.aside · two verbs refuse
rc=2
✋ ConstraintError: name one verb
   └─ see: rhx git.tree.aside --help

## tree.aside · an unknown argument refuses
rc=2
✋ ConstraintError: unknown argument '--bogus'
   └─ see: rhx git.tree.aside --help

