## tree.aside · a moved path refuses, entry kept
rc=2
🐢 lets lay it back...

✋ ConstraintError: HEAD moved 1 held path since 'moved' was set
   ├─ moved since the set
   │  └─ a.txt
   ├─ the entry is KEPT, and no file was touched
   └─ fix: read what it holds, then settle each path by hand: git stash show -p <sha>

## tree.aside · the kept entry still lists
rc=0
🐢 lets see what is aside...

🐚 git.tree.aside get
   └─ moved (<sha>)

## exec.set · --help
rc=0
file.exec.set — give a file inside this repo its exec bit

usage:
  rhx file.exec.set --path <file> [--path <file> …]

it refuses a path outside this repo, a dir, or a symlink

